<title>MEXICO: Mexico drops jet fuel prices - Pemex.</title>
<headline>Mexico drops jet fuel prices - Pemex.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexico's state oil and gas monopoly Petroleos Mexicanos (Pemex) lowered its jet fuel prices Tuesday to 1,686.59 pesos per cubic meter from 1,719.38 pesos, the company said.</p>
<p>Pemex periodically adjusts its jet fuel prices in accordance with international market prices.</p>
<p>((--Timna Tanners, Mexico City newsroom +525 728-7903)).</p>
</text>
